        },
        {
          "step_id": "unr_recovery_gravity",
          "text": "Only if they are breathing normally, roll them onto their side in the recovery position. If they are not breathing normally, go back to the first screen and start chest compressions. Whether the recovery position works as on Earth in partial gravity: to be set by clinical review.",
