        {
          "step_id": "unr_record_history",
          "text": "Ask what happened just before: a blow to the head, a faint, a fit or an alarm. Ask how long they have been like this, whether they have diabetes or any known illness, whether they are on any treatment, and whether there is any injury or bleeding.",
