          "review_state": "unreviewed"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "unr_bp",
          "text": "Put the cuff on the bare upper arm and follow the device instructions, arm supported and still. The level that needs action: to be set by clinical review. Never delay or stop keeping the airway open and watching their breathing for this.",
          "text_first_time": null,
          "who": "any_crew",
          "needs": {
